	(text "EN reset RC and BOOT pull-up"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 224.79 72.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a31d6705-6a58-53ba-a3f9-ae0aeda3d6f2")
	)
	(text "Notes\n- Module antenna end at the board edge: no copper, no vias in the antenna strip.\n- EN: 10k + 1u gives the reset delay; Tweezers across the EN and GND pads = reset.\n  BOOT = IO0 (strapping), 10k pull-up; tweezers across GND and IO0 = download mode. No buttons on this board.\n- UART0 pads TX RX 3V3 EN GND IO0 pads (2.54 mm pitch): GND sits between EN and IO0, so one tweezer bridges EN-GND (reset) or GND-IO0 (boot).\n- GPIO map matches firmware Kconfig DESK_BOARD_NOTIFIER_V1 (checked by hardware/tools/checks.py).\n- USB D+/D- (IO20/IO19) come from the Power sheet: coupled pair, keep short. Unused pins carry no-connect flags."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d9a5f624-24b4-5011-a9d8-46eb934e1082")
	)
